ts/449761534\",\"id\":449761534,\"node_id\":\"RA_kwDOIuuGOM4aztD-\",\"name\":\"SHA256SUMS.txt\",\"label\":\"\",\"uploader\":{\"login\":\"copilot-cli-release-app[bot]\",\"id\":238481402,\"node_id\":\"BOT_kgDODjbv-g\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/2127755?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-cli-release-app%5Bbot%5D\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/apps/copilot-cli-release-app\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-cli-release-app%5Bbot%5D/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-cli-release-app%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-cli-release-app%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-cli-release-app%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-cli-release-app%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-cli-release-app%5Bbot%5D/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-cli-release-app%5Bbot%5D/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-cli-release-app%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-cli-release-app%5Bbot%5D/received_events\",\"type\":\"Bot\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"content_type\":\"text/plain; charset=utf-8\",\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"size\":1756,\"digest\":\"sha256:b0f23d4042a569f305aefbeb6ff61e0e799c47287550df017cefc9cce6e6c697\",\"download_count\":1414,\"created_at\":\"2026-06-17T01:05:07Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-06-17T01:05:08Z\",\"browser_download_url\":\"https://github.com/github/copilot-cli/releases/download/v1.0.64-0/SHA256SUMS.txt\"}],\"tarball_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/github/copilot-cli/tarball/v1.0.64-0\",\"zipball_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/github/copilot-cli/zipball/v1.0.64-0\",\"body\":\"**Added**\\n- Add /diagnose command to analyze session logs\\n- Add /mcp registry installation for browsing and installing MCP servers\\n- Make `/security-review` available to all users without --experimental\\n- Discover MCP servers provided by installed plugins\\n- Add CSV output support for MCP tools\\n- Add /loop alias for the /every command\\n\\n**Improved**\\n- Slash-command picker name column widened from 25 to 35 characters so fewer long skill names are truncated\\n- Wrap long lines in /diff view so content no longer truncates\\n- Improve /diff hotkey labels for branch, whitespace, and tree navigation\\n\\n**Fixed**\\n- Remove bogus Ctrl+Enter VS Code keybinding created by old /terminal-setup\\n- Images returned by tools stay visible to the model across later turns and after resuming a session\\n- Preserve Markdown blockquotes in /share exports\\n- Filter long streamed results correctly when content exclusion is enabled\\n- Show a friendly message when additional usage limit is reached\\n- Search tools handle Windows-style glob patterns correctly\\n- Prevent kill self-protection from flagging quoted pipes and paths ending in kill\\n- Azure CLI, PowerShell, and Developer CLI credentials work again for Azure auth\\n\\n**Removed**\\n- Remove the legacy intent-reporting tool from the CLI\",\"reactions\":{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/github/copilot-cli/releases/340477326/reactions\",\"total_count\":5,\"+1\":3,\"-1\":0,\"laugh\":0,\"hooray\":0,\"confused\":0,\"heart\":2,\"rocket\":0,\"eyes\":0}}]"
