                        "text": "{\"events\":[{\"type\":\"assistant.message_start\",\"data\":{\"messageId\":\"82bc66df-c6ab-4d9a-8b5d-54ed6688ef7a\"},\"id\":\"a30d05e5-1019-49a3-9e8a-61d7e06899ff\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-19T12:44:40.684Z\",\"parentId\":\"3ac67acf-8f1c-473a-861a-7560a28fe399\",\"ephemeral\":true},{\"type\":\"assistant.usage\",\"data\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-4.6\",\"inputTokens\":23942,\"outputTokens\":299,\"cacheReadTokens\":21825,\"cacheWriteTokens\":2116,\"reasoningTokens\":0,\"cost\":3,\"duration\":7464,\"timeToFirstTokenMs\":6968,\"interTokenLatencyMs\":6.276315789473684,\"initiator\":\"agent\",\"apiCallId\":\"msg_bdrk_014PajjKucuHEk9AQ5TSqPez\",\"providerCallId\":\"CF3B:14B4FD:C89C664:D7FF810:6A3539B1\",\"serviceRequestId\":\"2015ad8d-272b-4137-a74b-d08e371a2ce5\",\"apiEndpoint\":\"/v1/messages\",\"quotaSnapshots\":{\"chat\":{\"isUnlimitedEntitlement\":true,\"entitlementRequests\":-1,\"usedRequests\":0,\"usageAllowedWithExhaustedQuota\":false,\"overage\":0,\"overageAllowedWithExhaustedQuota\":false,\"remainingPercentage\":100,\"resetDate\":\"2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z\"},\"completions\":{\"isUnlimitedEntitlement\":true,\"entitlementRequests\":-1,\"usedRequests\":0,\"usageAllowedWithExhaustedQuota\":false,\"overage\":0,\"overageAllowedWithExhaustedQuota\":false,\"remainingPercentage\":100,\"resetDate\":\"2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z\"},\"premium_interactions\":{\"isUnlimitedEntitlement\":true,\"entitlementRequests\":-1,\"usedRequests\":0,\"usageAllowedWithExhaustedQuota\":true,\"overage\":0,\"overageAllowedWithExhaustedQuota\":true,\"remainingPercentage\":100,\"resetDate\":\"2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z\"}},\"copilotUsage\":{\"tokenDetails\":[{\"batchSize\":1000000,\"costPerBatch\":500000000000,\"tokenCount\":1,\"tokenType\":\"input\"},{\"batchSize\":1000000,\"costPerBatch\":50000000000,\"tokenCount\":21825,\"tokenType\":\"cache_read\"},{\"batchSize\":1000000,\"costPerBatch\":625000000000,\"tokenCount\":2116,\"tokenType\":\"cache_write\"},{\"batchSize\":1000000,\"costPerBatch\":2500000000000,\"tokenCount\":299,\"tokenType\":\"output\"}],\"totalNanoAiu\":3161750000},\"reasoningEffort\":\"medium\",\"finishReason\":\"stop\",\"contentFilterTriggered\":false},\"id\":\"2cb7534c-0349-4031-8405-ff94a39c07a1\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-19T12:44:41.181Z\",\"parentId\":\"3ac67acf-8f1c-473a-861a-7560a28fe399\",\"ephemeral\":true},{\"type\":\"assistant.message\",\"data\":{\"messageId\":\"82bc66df-c6ab-4d9a-8b5d-54ed6688ef7a\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4.6\",\"content\":\"Here's the key information from **SPFx v1.23.0** (released May 13, 2025):\\n\\n## New Features\\n\\n1. **Grouping support for list view command sets** \u2014 Commands can now be grouped in the toolbar and context menu for lists/libraries.\\n\\n2. **Preview of SPFx CLI** \u2014 A new CLI (`@microsoft/spfx-cli`) that will replace the Yeoman generator. Templates are open-sourced on [GitHub](https://github.com/SharePoint/spfx). GA target: June 2026.\\n   ```\\n   npm install @microsoft/spfx-cli --global\\n   spfx create --template webpart-react --library-name my-spfx-library --component-name \\\"Hello World\\\"\\n   ```\\n\\n3. **npm audit fixes** \u2014 Resolved known vulnerabilities in the Yeoman package and scaffolded projects.\\n\\n## Deprecations\\n\\n- **Hosted workbench** \u2014 Last release with support; retiring Dec 1, 2026. Use the Debug Toolbar instead.\\n- **Geolocation in ACEs** \u2014 Deprecated, full retirement Dec 1, 2026.\\n\\n## Upgrade Note\\n\\nIf upgrading from <1.22, you must migrate from **Gulp toolchain to Heft toolchain**.\",\"toolRequests\":[],\"interactionId\":\"ae6d9157-99c1-4625-a84b-60772c392e42\",\"turnId\":\"1\",\"outputTokens\":299,\"requestId\":\"CF3B:14B4FD:C89C664:D7FF810:6A3539B1\",\"serviceRequestId\":\"2015ad8d-272b-4137-a74b-d08e371a2ce5\",\"apiCallId\":\"msg_bdrk_014PajjKucuHEk9AQ5TSqPez\"},\"id\":\"7908b8de-f6af-466c-b13e-476557c64743\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-19T12:44:41.182Z\",\"parentId\":\"3ac67acf-8f1c-473a-861a-7560a28fe399\"},{\"type\":\"assistant.turn_end\",\"data\":{\"turnId\":\"1\"},\"id\":\"8174473c-28f4-4cfa-bb1c-198ef5396b0e\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-19T12:44:41.195Z\",\"parentId\":\"7908b8de-f6af-466c-b13e-476557c64743\"},{\"type\":\"session.idle\",\"data\":{},\"id\":\"9c3d4cea-cc8a-4df8-9300-d2e5d1639004\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-19T12:44:41.196Z\",\"parentId\":\"8174473c-28f4-4cfa-bb1c-198ef5396b0e\",\"ephemeral\":true}]}",
